    "description": "You are given an integer array prices where prices[i] is the price of a given stock on the ith day.\nOn each day, you may decide to buy and/or sell the stock. You can only hold at most one share of the stock at any time. However, you can buy it then immediately sell it on the same day.\nFind and return the maximum profit you can achieve.\n<div class=\"constraints-wrapper\"><h3 class=\"constraint-header\">Constraints</h3><ul class=\"constraint-list\"><li>1 &lt;= prices.length &lt;= 3 * 104</li><li>0 &lt;= prices[i] &lt;= 104</li></ul></div>\n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 1</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> prices = [7,1,5,3,6,4]\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> 7\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span> Buy on day 2 (price = 1) and sell on day 3 (price = 5), profit = 5-1 = 4.\nThen buy on day 4 (price = 3) and sell on day 5 (price = 6), profit = 6-3 = 3.\nTotal profit is 4 + 3 = 7.</div>\n            </div>\n          \n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 2</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> prices = [1,2,3,4,5]\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> 4\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span> Buy on day 1 (price = 1) and sell on day 5 (price = 5), profit = 5-1 = 4.\nTotal profit is 4.</div>\n            </div>\n          \n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 3</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> prices = [7,6,4,3,1]\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> 0\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span> There is no way to make a positive profit, so we never buy the stock to achieve the maximum profit of 0.</div>\n            </div>\n          ",
