    "description": "Given a string queryIP, return \"IPv4\" if IP is a valid IPv4 address, \"IPv6\" if IP is a valid IPv6 address or \"Neither\" if IP is not a correct IP of any type.\nA valid IPv4 address is an IP in the form \"x1.x2.x3.x4\" where 0 <= xi <= 255 and xi cannot contain leading zeros. For example, \"192.168.1.1\" and \"192.168.1.0\" are valid IPv4 addresses while \"192.168.01.1\", \"192.168.1.00\", and \"192.168@1.1\" are invalid IPv4 addresses.\nA valid IPv6 address is an IP in the form \"x1:x2:x3:x4:x5:x6:x7:x8\" where:\nFor example, \"2001:0db8:85a3:0000:0000:8a2e:0370:7334\" and \"2001:db8:85a3:0:0:8A2E:0370:7334\" are valid IPv6 addresses, while \"2001:0db8:85a3::8A2E:037j:7334\" and \"02001:0db8:85a3:0000:0000:8a2e:0370:7334\" are invalid IPv6 addresses.\n<div class=\"constraints-wrapper\"><h3 class=\"constraint-header\">Constraints</h3><ul class=\"constraint-list\"><li>queryIP consists only of English letters, digits and the characters &#039;.&#039; and &#039;:&#039;.</li></ul></div>\n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 1</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> queryIP = \"172.16.254.1\"\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> \"IPv4\"\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span> This is a valid IPv4 address, return \"IPv4\".</div>\n            </div>\n          \n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 2</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> queryIP = \"2001:0db8:85a3:0:0:8A2E:0370:7334\"\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> \"IPv6\"\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span> This is a valid IPv6 address, return \"IPv6\".</div>\n            </div>\n          \n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 3</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> queryIP = \"256.256.256.256\"\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> \"Neither\"\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span> This is neither a IPv4 address nor a IPv6 address.</div>\n            </div>\n          ",
