    "description": "You are given a personal information string s, representing either an email address or a phone number. Return the masked personal information using the below rules.\nEmail address:\nAn email address is:\nTo mask an email:\nPhone number:\nA phone number is formatted as follows:\nTo mask a phone number:\n<div class=\"constraints-wrapper\"><h3 class=\"constraint-header\">Constraints</h3><ul class=\"constraint-list\"><li>s is either a valid email or a phone number.</li><li>If s is an email:\n\t\n8 &lt;= s.length &lt;= 40\ns consists of uppercase and lowercase English letters and exactly one &#039;@&#039; symbol and &#039;.&#039; symbol.</li><li>8 &lt;= s.length &lt;= 40</li><li>s consists of uppercase and lowercase English letters and exactly one &#039;@&#039; symbol and &#039;.&#039; symbol.</li><li>If s is a phone number:\n\t\n10 &lt;= s.length &lt;= 20\ns consists of digits, spaces, and the symbols &#039;(&#039;, &#039;)&#039;, &#039;-&#039;, and &#039;+&#039;.</li><li>10 &lt;= s.length &lt;= 20</li><li>s consists of digits, spaces, and the symbols &#039;(&#039;, &#039;)&#039;, &#039;-&#039;, and &#039;+&#039;.</li></ul></div>\n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 1</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> s = \"LeetCode@LeetCode.com\"\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> \"l*****e@leetcode.com\"\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span> s is an email address.\nThe name and domain are converted to lowercase, and the middle of the name is replaced by 5 asterisks.</div>\n            </div>\n          \n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 2</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> s = \"AB@qq.com\"\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> \"a*****b@qq.com\"\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span> s is an email address.\nThe name and domain are converted to lowercase, and the middle of the name is replaced by 5 asterisks.\nNote that even though \"ab\" is 2 characters, it still must have 5 asterisks in the middle.</div>\n            </div>\n          \n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 3</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> s = \"1(234)567-890\"\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> \"***-***-7890\"\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span> s is a phone number.\nThere are 10 digits, so the local number is 10 digits and the country code is 0 digits.\nThus, the resulting masked number is \"***-***-7890\".</div>\n            </div>\n          ",
