    "description": "Given a string s, determine if it is valid.\nA string s is valid if, starting with an empty string t = \"\", you can transform t into s after performing the following operation any number of times:\nReturn true if s is a valid string, otherwise, return false.\n<div class=\"constraints-wrapper\"><h3 class=\"constraint-header\">Constraints</h3><ul class=\"constraint-list\"><li>1 &lt;= s.length &lt;= 2 * 104</li><li>s consists of letters &#039;a&#039;, &#039;b&#039;, and &#039;c&#039;</li></ul></div>\n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 1</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> s = \"aabcbc\"\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> true\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span>\n\"\" -> \"abc\" -> \"aabcbc\"\nThus, \"aabcbc\" is valid.</div>\n            </div>\n          \n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 2</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> s = \"abcabcababcc\"\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> true\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span>\n\"\" -> \"abc\" -> \"abcabc\" -> \"abcabcabc\" -> \"abcabcababcc\"\nThus, \"abcabcababcc\" is valid.</div>\n            </div>\n          \n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 3</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> s = \"abccba\"\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> false\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span> It is impossible to get \"abccba\" using the operation.</div>\n            </div>\n          ",
