    "description": "Given an integer array nums and an integer k, modify the array in the following way:\nYou should apply this process exactly k times. You may choose the same index i multiple times.\nReturn the largest possible sum of the array after modifying it in this way.\n<div class=\"constraints-wrapper\"><h3 class=\"constraint-header\">Constraints</h3><ul class=\"constraint-list\"><li>1 &lt;= nums.length &lt;= 104</li><li>-100 &lt;= nums[i] &lt;= 100</li><li>1 &lt;= k &lt;= 104</li></ul></div>\n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 1</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> nums = [4,2,3], k = 1\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> 5\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span> Choose index 1 and nums becomes [4,-2,3].</div>\n            </div>\n          \n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 2</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> nums = [3,-1,0,2], k = 3\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> 6\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span> Choose indices (1, 2, 2) and nums becomes [3,1,0,2].</div>\n            </div>\n          \n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 3</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> nums = [2,-3,-1,5,-4], k = 2\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> 13\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span> Choose indices (1, 4) and nums becomes [2,3,-1,5,4].</div>\n            </div>\n          ",
