    "description": "Given an array of integers arr, return true if we can partition the array into three non-empty parts with equal sums.\nFormally, we can partition the array if we can find indexes i + 1 < j with (arr[0] + arr[1] + ... + arr[i] == arr[i + 1] + arr[i + 2] + ... + arr[j - 1] == arr[j] + arr[j + 1] + ... + arr[arr.length - 1])\n<div class=\"constraints-wrapper\"><h3 class=\"constraint-header\">Constraints</h3><ul class=\"constraint-list\"><li>3 &lt;= arr.length &lt;= 5 * 104</li><li>-104 &lt;= arr[i] &lt;= 104</li></ul></div>\n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 1</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> arr = [0,2,1,-6,6,-7,9,1,2,0,1]\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> true\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span> 0 + 2 + 1 = -6 + 6 - 7 + 9 + 1 = 2 + 0 + 1</div>\n            </div>\n          \n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 2</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> arr = [0,2,1,-6,6,7,9,-1,2,0,1]\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> false</div>\n            </div>\n          \n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 3</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> arr = [3,3,6,5,-2,2,5,1,-9,4]\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> true\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span> 3 + 3 = 6 = 5 - 2 + 2 + 5 + 1 - 9 + 4</div>\n            </div>\n          ",
