    "description": "Given an array points where points[i] = [xi, yi] represents a point on the X-Y plane, return true if these points are a boomerang.\nA boomerang is a set of three points that are all distinct and not in a straight line.\n<div class=\"constraints-wrapper\"><h3 class=\"constraint-header\">Constraints</h3><ul class=\"constraint-list\"><li>points.length == 3</li><li>points[i].length == 2</li><li>0 &lt;= xi, yi &lt;= 100</li></ul></div>\n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 1</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> points = [[1,1],[2,3],[3,2]]\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> true</div>\n            </div>\n          \n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 2</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> points = [[1,1],[2,2],[3,3]]\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> false</div>\n            </div>\n          ",
