    "description": "For two strings s and t, we say \"t divides s\" if and only if s = t + t + t + ... + t + t (i.e., t is concatenated with itself one or more times).\nGiven two strings str1 and str2, return the largest string x such that x divides both str1 and str2.\n<div class=\"constraints-wrapper\"><h3 class=\"constraint-header\">Constraints</h3><ul class=\"constraint-list\"><li>1 &lt;= str1.length, str2.length &lt;= 1000</li><li>str1 and str2 consist of English uppercase letters.</li></ul></div>\n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 1</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> str1 = \"ABCABC\", str2 = \"ABC\"\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> \"ABC\"</div>\n            </div>\n          \n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 2</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> str1 = \"ABABAB\", str2 = \"ABAB\"\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> \"AB\"</div>\n            </div>\n          \n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 3</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> str1 = \"LEET\", str2 = \"CODE\"\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> \"\"</div>\n            </div>\n          ",
