    "description": "You are given an array of integers arr and an integer target.\nYou have to find two non-overlapping sub-arrays of arr each with a sum equal target. There can be multiple answers so you have to find an answer where the sum of the lengths of the two sub-arrays is minimum.\nReturn the minimum sum of the lengths of the two required sub-arrays, or return -1 if you cannot find such two sub-arrays.\n<div class=\"constraints-wrapper\"><h3 class=\"constraint-header\">Constraints</h3><ul class=\"constraint-list\"><li>1 &lt;= arr.length &lt;= 105</li><li>1 &lt;= arr[i] &lt;= 1000</li><li>1 &lt;= target &lt;= 108</li></ul></div>\n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 1</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> arr = [3,2,2,4,3], target = 3\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> 2\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span> Only two sub-arrays have sum = 3 ([3] and [3]). The sum of their lengths is 2.</div>\n            </div>\n          \n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 2</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> arr = [7,3,4,7], target = 7\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> 2\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span> Although we have three non-overlapping sub-arrays of sum = 7 ([7], [3,4] and [7]), but we will choose the first and third sub-arrays as the sum of their lengths is 2.</div>\n            </div>\n          \n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 3</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> arr = [4,3,2,6,2,3,4], target = 6\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> -1\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span> We have only one sub-array of sum = 6.</div>\n            </div>\n          ",
