    "description": "Given a valid parentheses string s, return the nesting depth of s. The nesting depth is the maximum number of nested parentheses.\n<div class=\"constraints-wrapper\"><h3 class=\"constraint-header\">Constraints</h3><ul class=\"constraint-list\"><li>1 &lt;= s.length &lt;= 100</li><li>s consists of digits 0-9 and characters &#039;+&#039;, &#039;-&#039;, &#039;*&#039;, &#039;/&#039;, &#039;(&#039;, and &#039;)&#039;.</li><li>It is guaranteed that parentheses expression s is a VPS.</li></ul></div>\n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 1</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> s = \"(1+(2*3)+((8)/4))+1\"\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> 3\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span>\nDigit 8 is inside of 3 nested parentheses in the string.</div>\n            </div>\n          \n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 2</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> s = \"(1)+((2))+(((3)))\"\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> 3\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span>\nDigit 3 is inside of 3 nested parentheses in the string.</div>\n            </div>\n          \n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 3</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> s = \"()(())((()()))\"\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> 3</div>\n            </div>\n          ",
    "examples": [
      {
        "input": "s = \"(1+(2*3)+((8)/4))+1\"",
        "output": "3"
      },
      {
        "input": "s = \"(1)+((2))+(((3)))\"",
        "output": "3"
      },
      {
        "input": "s = \"()(())((()()))\"",
        "output": "3"
      }
    ],
    "starterCode": "/**\n * @param {string} s\n * @return {number}\n */\nvar maxDepth = function(s) {\n    \n};"
