    "description": "A certain bug's home is on the x-axis at position x. Help them get there from position 0.\nThe bug jumps according to the following rules:\nThe bug may jump forward beyond its home, but it cannot jump to positions numbered with negative integers.\nGiven an array of integers forbidden, where forbidden[i] means that the bug cannot jump to the position forbidden[i], and integers a, b, and x, return the minimum number of jumps needed for the bug to reach its home. If there is no possible sequence of jumps that lands the bug on position x, return -1.\n<div class=\"constraints-wrapper\"><h3 class=\"constraint-header\">Constraints</h3><ul class=\"constraint-list\"><li>1 &lt;= forbidden.length &lt;= 1000</li><li>1 &lt;= a, b, forbidden[i] &lt;= 2000</li><li>0 &lt;= x &lt;= 2000</li><li>All the elements in forbidden are distinct.</li><li>Position x is not forbidden.</li></ul></div>\n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 1</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> forbidden = [14,4,18,1,15], a = 3, b = 15, x = 9\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> 3\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span> 3 jumps forward (0 -> 3 -> 6 -> 9) will get the bug home.</div>\n            </div>\n          \n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 2</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> forbidden = [8,3,16,6,12,20], a = 15, b = 13, x = 11\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> -1</div>\n            </div>\n          \n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 3</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> forbidden = [1,6,2,14,5,17,4], a = 16, b = 9, x = 7\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> 2\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span> One jump forward (0 -> 16) then one jump backward (16 -> 7) will get the bug home.</div>\n            </div>\n          ",
