    "description": "Given a string s consisting only of characters 'a', 'b', and 'c'. You are asked to apply the following algorithm on the string any number of times:\nReturn the minimum length of s after performing the above operation any number of times (possibly zero times).\n<div class=\"constraints-wrapper\"><h3 class=\"constraint-header\">Constraints</h3><ul class=\"constraint-list\"><li>1 &lt;= s.length &lt;= 105</li><li>s only consists of characters &#039;a&#039;, &#039;b&#039;, and &#039;c&#039;.</li></ul></div>\n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 1</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> s = \"ca\"\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> 2\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span> You can't remove any characters, so the string stays as is.</div>\n            </div>\n          \n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 2</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> s = \"cabaabac\"\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> 0\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span> An optimal sequence of operations is:\n- Take prefix = \"c\" and suffix = \"c\" and remove them, s = \"abaaba\".\n- Take prefix = \"a\" and suffix = \"a\" and remove them, s = \"baab\".\n- Take prefix = \"b\" and suffix = \"b\" and remove them, s = \"aa\".\n- Take prefix = \"a\" and suffix = \"a\" and remove them, s = \"\".</div>\n            </div>\n          \n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 3</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> s = \"aabccabba\"\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> 3\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span> An optimal sequence of operations is:\n- Take prefix = \"aa\" and suffix = \"a\" and remove them, s = \"bccabb\".\n- Take prefix = \"b\" and suffix = \"bb\" and remove them, s = \"cca\".</div>\n            </div>\n          ",
