    "description": "You are given two strings word1 and word2. Merge the strings by adding letters in alternating order, starting with word1. If a string is longer than the other, append the additional letters onto the end of the merged string.\nReturn the merged string.\n<div class=\"constraints-wrapper\"><h3 class=\"constraint-header\">Constraints</h3><ul class=\"constraint-list\"><li>1 &lt;= word1.length, word2.length &lt;= 100</li><li>word1 and word2 consist of lowercase English letters.</li></ul></div>\n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 1</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> word1 = \"abc\", word2 = \"pqr\"\r\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> \"apbqcr\"\r\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span> The merged string will be merged as so:\r\nword1:  a   b   c\r\nword2:    p   q   r\r\nmerged: a p b q c r</div>\n            </div>\n          \n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 2</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> word1 = \"ab\", word2 = \"pqrs\"\r\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> \"apbqrs\"\r\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span> Notice that as word2 is longer, \"rs\" is appended to the end.\r\nword1:  a   b \r\nword2:    p   q   r   s\r\nmerged: a p b q   r   s</div>\n            </div>\n          \n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 3</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> word1 = \"abcd\", word2 = \"pq\"\r\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> \"apbqcd\"\r\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span> Notice that as word1 is longer, \"cd\" is appended to the end.\r\nword1:  a   b   c   d\r\nword2:    p   q \r\nmerged: a p b q c   d</div>\n            </div>\n          ",
