    "description": "You are given a 0-indexed 1-dimensional (1D) integer array original, and two integers, m and n. You are tasked with creating a 2-dimensional (2D) array with  m rows and n columns using all the elements from original.\nThe elements from indices 0 to n - 1 (inclusive) of original should form the first row of the constructed 2D array, the elements from indices n to 2 * n - 1 (inclusive) should form the second row of the constructed 2D array, and so on.\nReturn an m x n 2D array constructed according to the above procedure, or an empty 2D array if it is impossible.\n<div class=\"constraints-wrapper\"><h3 class=\"constraint-header\">Constraints</h3><ul class=\"constraint-list\"><li>1 &lt;= original.length &lt;= 5 * 104</li><li>1 &lt;= original[i] &lt;= 105</li><li>1 &lt;= m, n &lt;= 4 * 104</li></ul></div>\n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 1</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> original = [1,2,3,4], m = 2, n = 2\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> [[1,2],[3,4]]\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span> The constructed 2D array should contain 2 rows and 2 columns.\nThe first group of n=2 elements in original, [1,2], becomes the first row in the constructed 2D array.\nThe second group of n=2 elements in original, [3,4], becomes the second row in the constructed 2D array.</div>\n            </div>\n          \n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 2</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> original = [1,2,3], m = 1, n = 3\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> [[1,2,3]]\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span> The constructed 2D array should contain 1 row and 3 columns.\nPut all three elements in original into the first row of the constructed 2D array.</div>\n            </div>\n          \n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 3</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> original = [1,2], m = 1, n = 1\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> []\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span> There are 2 elements in original.\nIt is impossible to fit 2 elements in a 1x1 2D array, so return an empty 2D array.</div>\n            </div>\n          ",
