    "description": "A cell (r, c) of an excel sheet is represented as a string \"<col><row>\" where:\nYou are given a string s in the format \"<col1><row1>:<col2><row2>\", where <col1> represents the column c1, <row1> represents the row r1, <col2> represents the column c2, and <row2> represents the row r2, such that r1 <= r2 and c1 <= c2.\nReturn the list of cells (x, y) such that r1 <= x <= r2 and c1 <= y <= c2. The cells should be represented as strings in the format mentioned above and be sorted in non-decreasing order first by columns and then by rows.\n<div class=\"constraints-wrapper\"><h3 class=\"constraint-header\">Constraints</h3><ul class=\"constraint-list\"><li>s.length == 5</li><li>&#039;A&#039; &lt;= s[0] &lt;= s[3] &lt;= &#039;Z&#039;</li><li>&#039;1&#039; &lt;= s[1] &lt;= s[4] &lt;= &#039;9&#039;</li><li>s consists of uppercase English letters, digits and &#039;:&#039;.</li></ul></div>\n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 1</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> s = \"K1:L2\"\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> [\"K1\",\"K2\",\"L1\",\"L2\"]\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span>\nThe above diagram shows the cells which should be present in the list.\nThe red arrows denote the order in which the cells should be presented.</div>\n            </div>\n          \n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 2</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> s = \"A1:F1\"\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> [\"A1\",\"B1\",\"C1\",\"D1\",\"E1\",\"F1\"]\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span>\nThe above diagram shows the cells which should be present in the list.\nThe red arrow denotes the order in which the cells should be presented.</div>\n            </div>\n          ",
