    "description": "You are given a string s containing one or more words. Every consecutive pair of words is separated by a single space ' '.\nA string t is an anagram of string s if the ith word of t is a permutation of the ith word of s.\nReturn the number of distinct anagrams of s. Since the answer may be very large, return it modulo 109 + 7.\n<div class=\"constraints-wrapper\"><h3 class=\"constraint-header\">Constraints</h3><ul class=\"constraint-list\"><li>1 &lt;= s.length &lt;= 105</li><li>s consists of lowercase English letters and spaces &#039; &#039;.</li><li>There is single space between consecutive words.</li></ul></div>\n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 1</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> s = \"too hot\"\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> 18\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span> Some of the anagrams of the given string are \"too hot\", \"oot hot\", \"oto toh\", \"too toh\", and \"too oht\".</div>\n            </div>\n          \n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 2</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> s = \"aa\"\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> 1\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span> There is only one anagram possible for the given string.</div>\n            </div>\n          ",
