    "description": "You are given a 0-indexed integer array nums.\nInitially, all of the indices are unmarked. You are allowed to make this operation any number of times:\nReturn the maximum possible number of marked indices in nums using the above operation any number of times.\n<div class=\"constraints-wrapper\"><h3 class=\"constraint-header\">Constraints</h3><ul class=\"constraint-list\"><li>1 &lt;= nums.length &lt;= 105</li><li>1 &lt;= nums[i] &lt;= 109</li></ul></div>\n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 1</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> nums = [3,5,2,4]\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> 2\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span> In the first operation: pick i = 2 and j = 1, the operation is allowed because 2 * nums[2] <= nums[1]. Then mark index 2 and 1.\nIt can be shown that there's no other valid operation so the answer is 2.</div>\n            </div>\n          \n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 2</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> nums = [9,2,5,4]\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> 4\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span> In the first operation: pick i = 3 and j = 0, the operation is allowed because 2 * nums[3] <= nums[0]. Then mark index 3 and 0.\nIn the second operation: pick i = 1 and j = 2, the operation is allowed because 2 * nums[1] <= nums[2]. Then mark index 1 and 2.\nSince there is no other operation, the answer is 4.</div>\n            </div>\n          \n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 3</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> nums = [7,6,8]\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> 0\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span> There is no valid operation to do, so the answer is 0.</div>\n            </div>\n          ",
