    "description": "You are given an array nums of non-negative integers and an integer k.\nAn array is called special if the bitwise OR of all of its elements is at least k.\nReturn the length of the shortest special non-empty subarray of nums, or return -1 if no special subarray exists.\n<div class=\"constraints-wrapper\"><h3 class=\"constraint-header\">Constraints</h3><ul class=\"constraint-list\"><li>1 &lt;= nums.length &lt;= 50</li><li>0 &lt;= nums[i] &lt;= 50</li><li>0 &lt;= k &lt; 64</li></ul></div>\n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 1</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> nums = [1,2,3], k = 2\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> 1\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span>\nThe subarray [3] has OR value of 3 . Hence, we return 1 .\nNote that [2] is also a special subarray.</div>\n            </div>\n          \n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 2</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> nums = [2,1,8], k = 10\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> 3\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span>\nThe subarray [2,1,8] has OR value of 11 . Hence, we return 3 .</div>\n            </div>\n          \n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 3</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> nums = [1,2], k = 0\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> 1\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span>\nThe subarray [1] has OR value of 1 . Hence, we return 1 .</div>\n            </div>\n          ",
    "examples": [
      {
        "input": "nums = [1,2,3], k = 2",
        "output": "1"
      },
      {
        "input": "nums = [2,1,8], k = 10",
        "output": "3"
      },
      {
        "input": "nums = [1,2], k = 0",
        "output": "1"
      }
    ],
    "starterCode": "/**\n * @param {number[]} nums\n * @param {number} k\n * @return {number}\n */\nvar minimumSubarrayLength = function(nums, k) {\n    \n};"
