    "description": "You are given an integer n and a 2D array requirements, where requirements[i] = [endi, cnti] represents the end index and the inversion count of each requirement.\nA pair of indices (i, j) from an integer array nums is called an inversion if:\nReturn the number of permutations perm of [0, 1, 2, ..., n - 1] such that for all requirements[i], perm[0..endi] has exactly cnti inversions.\nSince the answer may be very large, return it modulo 109 + 7.\n<div class=\"constraints-wrapper\"><h3 class=\"constraint-header\">Constraints</h3><ul class=\"constraint-list\"><li>2 &lt;= n &lt;= 300</li><li>1 &lt;= requirements.length &lt;= n</li><li>requirements[i] = [endi, cnti]</li><li>0 &lt;= endi &lt;= n - 1</li><li>0 &lt;= cnti &lt;= 400</li><li>The input is generated such that there is at least one i such that endi == n - 1.</li><li>The input is generated such that all endi are unique.</li></ul></div>\n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 1</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> n = 3, requirements = [[2,2],[0,0]]\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> 2\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span>\nThe two permutations are:</div>\n            </div>\n          \n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 2</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> n = 3, requirements = [[2,2],[1,1],[0,0]]\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> 1\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span>\nThe only satisfying permutation is [2, 0, 1] :</div>\n            </div>\n          \n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 3</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> n = 2, requirements = [[0,0],[1,0]]\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> 1\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span>\nThe only satisfying permutation is [0, 1] :</div>\n            </div>\n          ",
