    "description": "You are given an array nums of n integers, and a 2D integer array queries of size q, where queries[i] = [li, ri].\nFor each query, you must find the maximum XOR score of any subarray of nums[li..ri].\nThe XOR score of an array a is found by repeatedly applying the following operations on a so that only one element remains, that is the score:\nReturn an array answer of size q where answer[i] is the answer to query i.\n<div class=\"constraints-wrapper\"><h3 class=\"constraint-header\">Constraints</h3><ul class=\"constraint-list\"><li>1 &lt;= n == nums.length &lt;= 2000</li><li>0 &lt;= nums[i] &lt;= 231 - 1</li><li>1 &lt;= q == queries.length &lt;= 105</li><li>queries[i].length == 2</li><li>queries[i] = [li, ri]</li><li>0 &lt;= li &lt;= ri &lt;= n - 1</li></ul></div>\n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 1</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> nums = [2,8,4,32,16,1], queries = [[0,2],[1,4],[0,5]]\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> [12,60,60]\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span>\nIn the first query, nums[0..2] has 6 subarrays [2] , [8] , [4] , [2, 8] , [8, 4] , and [2, 8, 4] each with a respective XOR score of 2, 8, 4, 10, 12, and 6. The answer for the query is 12, the largest of all XOR scores.\nIn the second query, the subarray of nums[1..4] with the largest XOR score is nums[1..4] with a score of 60.\nIn the third query, the subarray of nums[0..5] with the largest XOR score is nums[1..4] with a score of 60.</div>\n            </div>\n          \n            <div class=\"example-wrapper\">\n              <h3 class=\"example-header\">Example 2</h3>\n              <div class=\"example-block\"><br/><span class=\"ex-label input\">Input</span> nums = [0,7,3,2,8,5,1], queries = [[0,3],[1,5],[2,4],[2,6],[5,6]]\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label output\">Output</span> [7,14,11,14,5]\n<br/><span class=\"ex-label explain\">Explanation</span></div>\n            </div>\n          ",
